# Build context for the orchestrator image.
#
# The context is ALLOWLISTED: `**` excludes everything, and then each
# thing the image needs is re-included. See the registry's
# .dockerignore for why the module directory is re-included as a
# directory rather than one line per file — adding a module must not
# mean remembering to update two lists.
**
!services/orchestrator/Dockerfile.orchestrator
!services/orchestrator/package.json
!services/orchestrator/service.mjs
!services/orchestrator/lib/
